{"text": "After four weeks, the witch was tired of waiting. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Fat or thin, Hansel will be my dinner today, she said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She heated the big oven and told Gretel to look inside. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But Gretel said, I do not know how to do it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Silly goose, cried the witch, and she put her own head inside. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Quickly Gretel pushed her in and shut the iron door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The witch was never seen again, and Gretel ran to free Hansel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the witchs house they found pearls and shining jewels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A white duck carried them across a wide lake, one at a time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When they got home, their father was happier than ever before. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The woman had died, and they all lived happily together.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "f", "t", "e", "r", " ", "f", "o", "u", "r", " ", "w", "e", "e", "k", "s", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "t", "c", "h", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "t", "i", "r", "e", "d", " ", "o", "f", " ", "w", "a", "i", "t", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "F", "a", "t", " ", "o", "r", " ", "t", "h", "i", "n", ",", " ", "H", "a", "n", "s", "e", "l", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "b", "e", " ", "m", "y", " ", "d", "i", "n", "n", "e", "r", " ", "t", "o", "d", "a", "y", ",", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "h", "e", "a", "t", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "i", "g", " ", "o", "v", "e", "n", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "o", "l", "d", " ", "G", "r", "e", "t", "e", "l", " ", "t", "o", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", " ", "i", "n", "s", "i", "d", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", 